---
description: When editing the OpenAPI spec or transport, follow the edit-openapi skill and regenerate.
globs:
  - "api/**"
  - "internal/transport/**/*.go"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the `edit-openapi` skill. Change `api/openapi.yaml` before generated transport code.

Leave `internal/transport/openapi/api.gen.go` untouched. Regenerate with `make generate`, then `git diff --exit-code internal/transport/openapi`.
